#   ChromeContentBrowserClientCef::OpenURL sends service workers'
#   clients.openWindow there when wubble hosts the APIs.
# Why: without a Browser, Chromium either fails (tabs.create) or makes an
#   unmanaged native Chrome window with no CEF client (openOptionsPage,
#   clients.openWindow; chrome_browser_delegate.cc), which wubble cannot show
